From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: include <string.h> for strerror()

init calls strerror() but never includes <string.h>, relying on some other
header to declare it.  With the Prism and mlibc revisions the sysroot is
built against, none does.
---
 Source/Aurora/main.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Source/Aurora/main.cpp b/Source/Aurora/main.cpp
index 75c2eee..21de3e2 100644
--- a/Source/Aurora/main.cpp
+++ b/Source/Aurora/main.cpp
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@
 #include <cryptix/syscall.h>
 #include <fcntl.h>
 #include <signal.h>
+#include <string.h>
 #include <sys/mman.h>
 #include <sys/mount.h>
 #include <sys/socket.h>
